  "title": "Defender Dakar Packs Rally Tech in a Street-Legal Package",
  "summary": "The Defender, which morphed into a standalone brand under the Land Rover umbrella, won its class in the 2026 Dakar Rally with an off-roader dubbed D7X-R. The brand is now injecting some of its desert-proven technology into a limited-edition super-SUV. Due out in 2027, the Defender Dakar will feature a 626-horsepower V-8, a rally-ready suspension […]",
